  "intro_full_description": "Welcome to the wizard for localization (i18n) management and automation.<br><br>This Control Room allows you to decompose and finely control every stage of the process:<br><br>• <b>🔍 Step 1.1 (Scanning):</b> Analyzes the source code and generates the whitelist CSV.<br><br>• <b>🤖 Step 2 (AI Classification):</b> Leverages artificial intelligence to assign semantic keys.<br><br>• <b>⚙️ Step 3.1 & 3.2 (JSON & Code):</b> Updates the main JSON file and replaces texts in the source code.<br><br>• <b>🌍 Step 4 (Multi-language):</b> Manages synchronization and automatic translation of JSON files into target languages.<br><br><i>Use the 'Next' buttons below or select an item directly from the left menu to configure the steps.</i>",
  "step_3_1_description": "This module handles consolidating approved keys into the selected main language JSON file (e.g., en.json), assigning namespaces and structuring the semantic keys derived from the classification CSV.",
  "step_3_2_description": "This module replaces literal strings in the Python source code with structured i18n calls (e.g., self.i18n.t(...)), based on the recorded decisions.",
